INFO 2026-05-19 15:27:10,148 chat_sync.sync [request_id=EA87CD04-9288-4307-A1F0-05F616256598] chat push payload request_id=EA87CD04-9288-4307-A1F0-05F616256598 user_id=3 content_type=application/json body={"messages":[{"thread_id":"50e2b9e0-a4a4-46ad-879a-871318abb2a6","role":"user","model_name":"user","client_message_id":"01e5ee5f-d5d7-4e05-940f-b055b3897691","delivery_state":"pending","created_at":"2026-05-19 15:27:09.433000+00:00","tombstone":false,"thread_current_model_name":"deepseek-v4-pro","thread_temperature":0.6,"thread_top_p":1.0,"thread_max_tokens":14096,"thread_max_messages":20,"thread_role_prompt":"你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。\n{{CURRENT_DATE}}","blocks":[{"kind":"imageGallery","updated_at":"2026-05-19T15:27:09.000Z","attachments":[{"file_id":469,"url":"https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260519/B858713B-B8F1-433F-A9E1-DD3346C19C45/IMG_2030.jpeg","full_cache_key":"b858713b-b8f1-433f-a9e1-dd3346c19c45/IMG_2030.jpeg","id":"021C97B1-6D52-4F8C-BEC0-B36453ED87F9","type":"image","text":"门诊号：0000319050\n窗口：6号\n她名 赵道凯\n传別：男\n年龄：27岁\n科室：皮肤科门诊\n2026 04/20 262\n诊断：结膜炎\n药品名称 成格\n药品数量用法\n（MY25 02 04） 普拉洛芬滴眼\n液（普南扑贝）\n1盒\n5上、51\nMi25 02-04\n2 1/192.168.31.39\n扣法：滴眼 每天1次 每次1滴\n支有提示：无\n商眼液（爱赛平）\n（MY25-01-04）盐酸氮卓斯灯\n1盒\n1a:31g0.05%\nMi2: 01-04\n旧U..商眼 每天2次 每次1滴\n可刀：开后软製后，使不可搖过四间。\n1盒\nMY19-03-02\n用法：口服-每下2次 每次2袋\n不起$30\n按存.\n友清提水：\n请感仔细长对药品，如您所取药\n白日录\n不考或有疑问，请暂勿使用。\n药品一经发小，\n概小退换。\n咨询电话：\n0512 6595523/\n容间电话。0512 65955223\n药物线下咨前\n周一至周扣门診药房咨制室\n周四下午-或周五下不點望门这樣班\n关注的学郎公\n上容间","file_md5":"1b74a23cee7f2c3f5614227c47089f5a"}],"status":"ready","revision":1,"created_at":"2026-05-19T15:27:09.000Z","id":"35D93C20-DFC6-4ED3-9149-D744302D470D"}]}]}
